# Dataset Documentation

## Dataset Information

**Name:** Power Consumption of Tetouan City
**Source:** UCI Machine Learning Repository
**Source URL:** https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/849/power+consumption+
**Licence:** Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

## Dataset Structure

The CSV contains 52,416 observations and 9 columns, covering 1 January to 30 December 2017, with measurements every 10 minutes.

## Variables

- DateTime
- Temperature
- Humidity
- Wind Speed
- General Diffuse Flows
- Diffuse Flows
- Zone 1 Power Consumption
- Zone 2 Power Consumption
- Zone 3 Power Consumption

## Project Relevance

The dataset will support the analysis of electricity consumption patterns and the development of one-hour-ahead forecasting models to anticipate peak-demand periods.

## Initial Data Quality Assessment

The initial inspection found no missing values or duplicate timestamps. Measurements follow a regular ten-minute interval.

## Limitations

The dataset covers a single city and one year. It does not contain electricity prices, infrastructure capacity or outage records.
